&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#what-is-an-ai-agent"&gt;What is an AI agent?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#is-an-ai-agent-the-right-fit-for-your-workflow"&gt;Is an AI agent the right fit for your workflow?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#how-to-create-an-ai-agent"&gt;How to Create an AI Agent&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
